    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Very Rare (Requires Attunement)</em></p><p>While wearing this crown, you can take a Magic action to let out a mighty belch that can be heard up to 300 feet away. Each creature in a 20-foot Cone originating from you makes a DC 17 Strength saving throw. On a failed save, a creature is pushed up to 20 feet away from you and has the Prone condition.</p><p><strong>Curse.</strong> This item is cursed. Attuning to it curses you until you are targeted by a @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRemoveCurs]{Remove Curse} spell or similar magic; taking off the crown doesn’t end the curse. While cursed, you are far hungrier than normal: you lose all your table manners, and your daily food requirement triples.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-XHpLQ6CeG8x636RC\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Poussez à la main de 20 pieds les créatures qui ratent leur jet.</p></section>",
